\code{psiminn} values (on fewer, binning noise alone crosses the usual
bands). A column that cannot be tested (all missing on one side, one
category, of a type that is neither numbers nor labels) has \code{flag}
\code{NA}, and \code{note} says why. Missing values are left out of each test;
\code{nref} and \code{ncur} are the counts that entered it.

